# Names only. Real values never go in git.
# Copy to .dev.vars for local development (that file is ignored).
#
# APLYD_ENV: local | synthetic | test. Synthetic sign-in refuses to run for any other value.
# SESSION_SECRET: at least 32 bytes of random text (for example `openssl rand -hex 32`). Shorter, or one repeated character, and sign-in is refused.
APLYD_ENV=
SESSION_SECRET=
